@@ -0,0 +1,1099 @@
+"""
+modeling_prismatic_layerprune.py
+
+Gated variants of PrismaticForConditionalGeneration and OpenVLAForActionPrediction
+that support layer gating for the two-stage layer pruning framework.
+
+Changes vs. modeling_prismatic.py:
+  - GatedLlamaModel: LlamaModel with optional `layer_gates` parameter.
+  - GatedLlamaForCausalLM: LlamaForCausalLM using GatedLlamaModel.
+  - GatedPrismaticForConditionalGeneration: Uses GatedLlamaForCausalLM; passes `layer_gates`.
+  - GatedOpenVLAForActionPrediction: Inherits from gated Prismatic; action prediction unchanged.
+"""
+
