+Two-stage layer pruning fine-tuning for OpenVLA-OFT with OFFLINE teacher caching.
+  Phase 1: Soft pruning with Gumbel-Sigmoid gated network + distillation.
+  Phase 2: Hard pruning (physical layer removal) + distillation fine-tuning.
+
+When teacher_cache_dir is set, teacher outputs are loaded from pre-computed cache
+instead of running the teacher model online, saving ~14-15 GB GPU memory.
+
+Based on finetune_layer_pruning.py with offline teacher cache support.
